                                "sense_id": "d15fc5b4-e6cf-3694-bf92-b76d830b1723",
                                "text": "And as their valour, so you trow, defied / on aspe'rous voyage cruel harm and sore, / so many changing skies their manhood tried, / such climes where storm-winds blow and billows roar; […]"
